=== ChromaLink vision tuning ladder (spec: sample 50->40, bias -7->-10, tolerance 45->55) ===
baseline (0.25/-7/45), 30-frame probe: N60 24/30, N100 22/30 (gates need 98%/95%)
step1 sampleHalf 0.25->0.20: N60 24/30, N100 22/30 (no change)
step2 bias -7->-10: N60 24/30, N100 22/30 (no change)
step3 tolerance 45->55: N60 26/30, N100 22/30 (helped N60)
post-ladder structural work (not knob tuning): structural finder verification & scoring,
corner/edge tracing at capture resolution, leave-one-out anchor subsets, template alignment
with separator ring, dual/triple detection scales (240/320 fallback), candidate-list decoding,
errors-and-erasures RS, per-band purity offsets, BR corner sweep incl. calibration-free rescue.
FINAL official gates (seeds 0xa100/0xa060, mixed beacon parity): N100 95.0% (>=95 PASS),
N60 99.0% (>=98 PASS). Blur radius 3 rejected at native-scale capture (sharpness sigma metric).

